  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairclaim-prior-authorizations",
  "description": "Fairclaim Prior Authorizations: matches claims or scheduled services to your prior-authorization log and 278 responses, and flags services with no authorization, expired or not-yet-valid dates, codes not on the authorization, units used up, pended or denied reviews, and authorizations about to run out.",
